==Trivia==
* ''Survivor 51'' is the first season since {{S2|40}} to start with only two competing tribes.<ref>https://us.auditioncentre.com/reality-tv-news/survivor-51-going-back-to-two-tribes/#google_vignette%20</ref>
* ''Survivor 51'' is the first season since {{S2|14}} to start with an odd number of castaways, with 21 castaways competing.
** This is the first season to intentionally do so, as ''Fiji'' was intended to have 20 castaways prior to [[Mellisa McNulty]] withdrawing.
* ''Survivor 51'' is the third season to start with an unequal number of male and female castaways, after ''Fiji'' and {{S2|29}}.
** This season also marks the first season with more female castaways (11) than male castaways (10).

